.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,IESUDialogue: 1,0:02:31.51,0:02:32.16,Kanji,,0,0,0,fx,イエス・Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.86,0:02:32.29,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,WIIDialogue: 1,0:02:31.86,0:02:32.29,Kanji,,0,0,0,fx,ウィーDialogue: 1,0:02:31.99,0:02:33.04,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,KYAN!Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.99,0:02:33.04,Kanji,,0,0,0,fx,キャン！Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.84,0:02:38.27,Title,,0,0,0,,Lola's Vivre CardDialogue: 0,0:02:36.35,0:02:38.22,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.22,0:02:42.45,Main,,0,0,0,,They've multiplied and are barking like animals!Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.26,0:02:42.23,Captions,,0,0,0,,Seducing WoodsDialogue: 0,0:02:42.45,0:02:44.51,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened to you guys?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.01,0:02:48.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Aren't any of you real?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.44,0:02:50.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.80,0:02:54.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding! Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.60,0:02:56.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Carrot!Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.99,0:02:58.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.48,0:03:00.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Untie me!Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.79,0:03:06.51,Main,,0,0,0,,She's talking like a human!Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.51,0:03:08.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm the real one!Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.21,0:03:14.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen up! I was looking for you!Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.89,0:03:16.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Why did you just grab me like that?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.98,0:03:20.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I... I'm really sowwy...Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.46,0:03:25.47,Main,,0,0,0,,But this is pretty crazy. What's going on?Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.02,0:03:31.84,Main,,0,0,0,,This one certainly looks like me.Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.84,0:03:36.48,Main,,0,0,0,,This would be easy if the real ones were all among them.Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.66,0:03:39.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, you guys were the ones who multiplied!Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.61,0:03:42.64,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't multiply! I mean, we did, but...Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.48,0:03:48.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.49,0:03:50.12,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.44,0:03:52.41,Main,,0,0,0,,You know what happened, don't you?Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.41,0:03:56.48,Main,,0,0,0,,You were here the whole time, even when we were attacked by that woman!Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.48,0:03:58.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't see anything!Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.33,0:04:00.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened?Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.62,0:04:03.94,Main,,0,0,0,,I was attacked by you, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.94,0:04:04.89,Main,,0,0,0,,By me?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.89,0:04:11.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Technically, it wasn't you. But it was a fake that we tried to escape with!Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.11,0:04:12.19,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.96,0:04:20.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, that "Luffy" suddenly turned into a giant woman and attacked us...Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.93,0:04:28.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.97,0:04:30.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Who are you-teia?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.95,0:04:33.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Brûlée!Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.96,0:04:35.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Brûlée?Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.57,0:04:41.30,Main,,0,0,0,,A cute rabbit and a pretty girl... How nice...Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.30,0:04:44.32,Main,,0,0,0,,When I see those beautiful faces...Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.96,0:04:48.39,Main,,0,0,0,,it makes me want to scratch them up!Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.22,0:04:51.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.69,0:04:52.89,Main,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.99,0:04:55.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-Where's Luffy?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.52,0:04:58.22,Main,,0,0,0,,"Where", indeed.Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.22,0:05:01.69,Main,,0,0,0,,He's probably wandering lost in the forest.Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.24,0:05:06.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Clima-Tact!Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.95,0:05:23.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami, are you okay?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.67,0:05:26.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! That was close!Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.37,0:05:28.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Usopp!Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.22,0:05:30.22,Main,,0,0,0,,You cheeky little...Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.34,0:05:38.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Carrot!Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.37,0:05:39.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:46.78,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,EDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:46.78,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,EDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:46.78,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,EDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:46.94,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,lDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:46.94,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,lDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:46.94,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,lDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:46.94,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:46.94,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:46.94,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,cDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,cDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,cDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,lDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,lDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,lDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,wDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,wDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,wDialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,!Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,!Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.44,0:05:47.13,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,!Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.78,0:05:47.04,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,m 30 23 b 24 23 24 33 30 33 b 36 33 37 23 30 23 m 35 27 l 60 28 l 35 29 m 26 27 l 0 28 l 26 29 m 29 23 l 30 0 l 31 23 m 29 33 l 30 56 l 31 33Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.78,0:05:47.24,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,EDialogue: 0,0:05:46.94,0:05:47.23,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,m 30 23 b 24 23 24 33 30 33 b 36 33 37 23 30 23 m 35 27 l 60 28 l 35 29 m 26 27 l 0 28 l 26 29 m 29 23 l 30 0 l 31 23 m 29 33 l 30 56 l 31 33Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.94,0:05:47.43,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,leDialogue: 0,0:05:47.13,0:05:47.42,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,m 30 23 b 24 23 24 33 30 33 b 36 33 37 23 30 23 m 35 27 l 60 28 l 35 29 m 26 27 l 0 28 l 26 29 m 29 23 l 30 0 l 31 23 m 29 33 l 30 56 l 31 33Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.13,0:05:47.62,Carrot,,0,0,0,fx,claw!Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.62,0:05:56.14,Main,,0,