5 19 b 4 18 2 16 1 11 b 1 8 2 5 4 3 b 5 2 6 1 7 1 b 8 3 8 4 9 5 b 10 4 10 3 11 1 b 13 2 14 3 14 3 b 16 5 17 8 17 11 b 16 16 14 18 13 19 b 11 21 10 22 9 23Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.22,0:09:56.08,Chopper,,0,0,0,fx,m 9 23 b 8 22 7 21 6 20 b 4 18 3 16 2 12 b 2 9 3 5 4 3 b 5 2 6 1 7 1 b 8 3 8 4 9 5 b 10 4 10 3 11 1 b 13 2 14 3 14 3 b 15 5 16 8 16 12 b 15 16 14 18 12 20 b 11 21 10 22 9 9 b 8 22 7 21 5 19 b 4 18 2 16 1 11 b 1 8 2 5 4 3 b 5 2 6 1 7 1 b 8 3 8 4 9 5 b 10 4 10 3 11 1 b 13 2 14 3 14 3 b 16 5 17 8 17 11 b 16 16 14 18 13 19 b 11 21 10 22 9 23Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.22,0:09:56.08,Chopper,,0,0,0,fx,m 9 23 b 8 22 7 21 6 20 b 4 18 3 16 2 12 b 2 9 3 5 4 3 b 5 2 6 1 7 1 b 8 3 8 4 9 5 b 10 4 10 3 11 1 b 13 2 14 3 14 3 b 15 5 16 8 16 12 b 15 16 14 18 12 20 b 11 21 10 22 9 9 b 8 22 7 21 5 19 b 4 18 2 16 1 11 b 1 8 2 5 4 3 b 5 2 6 1 7 1 b 8 3 8 4 9 5 b 10 4 10 3 11 1 b 13 2 14 3 14 3 b 16 5 17 8 17 11 b 16 16 14 18 13 19 b 11 21 10 22 9 23Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.22,0:09:56.08,Chopper,,0,0,0,fx,m 9 23 b 8 22 7 21 6 20 b 4 18 3 16 2 12 b 2 9 3 5 4 3 b 5 2 6 1 7 1 b 8 3 8 4 9 5 b 10 4 10 3 11 1 b 13 2 14 3 14 3 b 15 5 16 8 16 12 b 15 16 14 18 12 20 b 11 21 10 22 9 9 b 8 22 7 21 5 19 b 4 18 2 16 1 11 b 1 8 2 5 4 3 b 5 2 6 1 7 1 b 8 3 8 4 9 5 b 10 4 10 3 11 1 b 13 2 14 3 14 3 b 16 5 17 8 17 11 b 16 16 14 18 13 19 b 11 21 10 22 9 23Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.22,0:09:56.08,Chopper,,0,0,0,fx,m 9 23 b 8 22 7 21 6 20 b 4 18 3 16 2 12 b 2 9 3 5 4 3 b 5 2 6 1 7 1 b 8 3 8 4 9 5 b 10 4 10 3 11 1 b 13 2 14 3 14 3 b 15 5 16 8 16 12 b 15 16 14 18 12 20 b 11 21 10 22 9 9 b 8 22 7 21 5 19 b 4 18 2 16 1 11 b 1 8 2 5 4 3 b 5 2 6 1 7 1 b 8 3 8 4 9 5 b 10 4 10 3 11 1 b 13 2 14 3 14 3 b 16 5 17 8 17 11 b 16 16 14 18 13 19 b 11 21 10 22 9 23Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.22,0:09:56.08,Chopper,,0,0,0,fx,m 9 23 b 8 22 7 21 6 20 b 4 18 3 16 2 12 b 2 9 3 5 4 3 b 5 2 6 1 7 1 b 8 3 8 4 9 5 b 10 4 10 3 11 1 b 13 2 14 3 14 3 b 15 5 16 8 16 12 b 15 16 14 18 12 20 b 11 21 10 22 9 9 b 8 22 7 21 5 19 b 4 18 2 16 1 11 b 1 8 2 5 4 3 b 5 2 6 1 7 1 b 8 3 8 4 9 5 b 10 4 10 3 11 1 b 13 2 14 3 14 3 b 16 5 17 8 17 11 b 16 16 14 18 13 19 b 11 21 10 22 9 23Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.16,0:10:10.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at that! You were already interesting, but you're able to do this too?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.88,0:10:14.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama will be happy!Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:20.14,Main,,0,0,0,,She doesn't just collect "all of the races". She collects the "freaks", too.Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.51,0:10:25.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, catch them!Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.96,0:10:31.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop, you brat!Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.34,0:10:35.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Go away!Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.74,0:10:41.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Where are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.87,0:10:48.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, I kept running around...Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.59,0:10:51.88,Main,,0,0,0,,And looked for you until it got dark...Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:55.69,Main,,0,0,0,,I see! I'm glad that you found me!Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.69,0:10:56.92,Main,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.92,0:11:01.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go save Chopper and Carrot right now! Where are they?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.22,0:11:02.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Right here.Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.73,0:11:06.21,Main,,0,0,0,,All of that happened right here.Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.21,0:11:11.57,Main,,0,0,0,,But now, they're all gone. That's why I'm asking this guy!Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.57,0:11:15.83,Main,,0,0,0,,You were watching the whole time! Where's Chopper? And what about Carrot?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.83,0:11:20.65,Main,,0,0,0,,That Brûlée lady and the forest monsters didn't mess with you at all!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.91,0:11:23.11,Main,,0,0,0,,That means you're one of them!Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.93,0:11:28.16,Main,,0,0,0,,One of them? Well, we're not enemies...Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.16,0:11:33.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! If you want to know, bring me some apple juice from over on my left...Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.79,0:11:35.71,Main,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for that!Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.71,0:11:40.25,Main,,0,0,0,,If you tell us something useful, then sure, we'll bring it to you!Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.25,0:11:41.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Really?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.27,0:11:44.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, since you've been mentioning it so much, I wanna try it too.Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.69,0:11:46.63,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way,Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.32,0:11:49.85,Main,,0,0,0,,you look pretty strong, but...Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.17,0:11:55.06,Main,,0,0,0,,...are you?Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.06,0:11:57.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, I am strong! Why does that matter?Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.58,0:12:02.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. Appearances aren't everything, I guess.Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.80,0:12:07.46,Main,,0,0,0,,That reindeer guy was surprisingly strong,Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.46,0:12:12.37,Main,,0,0,0,,but the trees of the forest attacked him without hesitation.Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.15,0:12:18.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Once they get an order, they don't stop...Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.03,0:12:21.62,Main,,0,0,0,,...until they complete it!Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.89,0:12:27.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Really? Then, why did they stop attacking me?Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.14,0:12:32.61,Main,,0,0,0,,When I beat a bunch of them, they left me alone, too!Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.61,0:12:36.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, how are they alive, anyways?Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.07,0:12:40.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Every six months, every resident of Totto Land...Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.22,0:12:44.07,Main,,0,0,0,,...must pay a month's worth of their "soul"...Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.07,0:12:46.30,Main,,0,0,0,,to the kingdom, in exchange for their safety.Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.30,0:12:47.25,Main,,0,0,0,,"Soul"?Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.25,0:12:50.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, their lifespan, basically.Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.74,0:12:54.20,Main,,0,0,0,,So the people lose two months of their lifespan in a year...Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.20,0:12:58.65,Main,,0,0,0,,...and one year of their lifespan for every six.Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.65,0:12:59.79,Main,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.79,0:13:05.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Linlin, I mean, Big Mom ate the Soul-Soul Fruit.Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.08,0:13:11.58,Main,,0,0,0,,She can manipulate people's souls.Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.58,0:13:17.15,Main,,0,0,0,,With that power, she takes the life span of her citizens...Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.15,0:13:24.49,Main,,0,0,0,,At that moment, the citizens have to choose to stay in Totto Land or leave.Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.21,0:13:30.36,Main,,0,0,0,,And by spreading the collected souls all over the country,Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.36,0:13:34.75,Main,,0,0,0,,all kinds of things take on a life of their own.Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.75,0:13:40.71,Main,,0,0,0,,We call those who came to life the Homies.Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.39,0:13:43.57,Main,,0,0,0,,The collection and distribution of souls...Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.57,0:13:50.68,Main,,0,0,0,,...is handled by Linlin's, um, Big Mom's incarnations made of her own soul.Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.43,0:13:55.64,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what happens in Totto Land.Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.64,0:13:59.74,Main,,0,0,0,,When we first arrived, there were lots of odd things alive in the town of chocolate.Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.74,0:14:04.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that why the crocodile was able to talk?! And the human-like rabbit?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.23,0:14:08.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right. Animals can be personified, too.Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.52,0:14:10.19,Main,,0,0,0,,What an incredible ability!Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.19,0:14:11.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, what about these guys?Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.84,0:14:14.65,Main,,0,0,0,,They're something else.Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.65,0:14:20.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Brûlée used her ability to turn normal animals into people.Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.71,0:14:26.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, souls can't be put into other people or corpses.Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.99,0:14:30.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me that before?! You've been watching me the whole time...Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.84,0:14:34.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Because I didn't want to get involved!Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.06,0:14:37.23,Main,,0,0,0,,If you didn't want to get involved, then why are you buried here?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.23,0:14:39.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?! Who are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.31,0:14:43.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Tell me! I'll get you the juice!Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.77,0:14:49.74,Main,,0,0,0,,O-Okay! I'll tell you! Just get off of me!  Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.20,0:15:02.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Long ago, very long ago, I was Big Mom's... I mean, the pirate Charlotte Linlin's...Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.08,0:15:06.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Linlin's...Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.76,0:15:14.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Linlin's husband!Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.01,0:15:17.04,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.44,0:15:30.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-Why is one of the Three Sweet Commanders here?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.24,0:15:38.00,Captions,,0,0,0,,One of the Three Sweet Commanders of the Big Mom Pirates The Minister of Biscuits Charlotte Cracker (10th Son)Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.49,0:15:38.00,Main,,0,0,1,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.83,0:15:43.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going to...Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.88,0:15:46.07,Main,,0,0,0,,...put an end...Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.07,0:15:48.09,Main,,0,0,0,,...to your life!Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.87,0:16:00.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom's...Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.96,0:16:03.77,Main,,0,0,0,,...Ex-husband?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.77,0:16:05.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.34,0:16:12.82,Main,,0,0,0,,We had two daughters, and then she threw me out.Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.95,0:16:19.94,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not that nobody's after me...Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.94,0:16:22.79,Main,,0,0,0,,They just don't pay attention to me!Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.09,0:16:30.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.40,0:16:48.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Who's that?Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.03,0:17:02.97,Main,,0,0,0,,S-Sir, what brings you here?Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.97,0:17:05.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Am I not allowed to be here?Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.87,0:17:08.88,Main,,0,0,0,,No! Of course you are.Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.80,0:17:19.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.81,0:17:26.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.44,0:17:27.56,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.56,0:17:29.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.53,0:17:37.07,Main,,0,0,0,,--His body's coming out! --Get back, Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.07,0:17:40.49,Main,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.83,0:17:50.92,Main,,0,0,0,,We thought he was a Giant!Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.18,0:18:05.52,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you? What kind of a fool just gives the enemy information like that?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:08.59,Main,,0,0,0,,W-Wait, Cracker-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.59,0:18:12.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to see my daughter, Chiffon, even if only for a moment!Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.67,0:18:19.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard she got married! I want to congratulate her!Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.90,0:18:24.83,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I need you to let me talk to Linlin!Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.72,0:18:28.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Also, I heard that Lola ran away!Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.32,0:18:33.96,Main,,0,0,0,,They're both my precious daughters!Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.96,0:18:35.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Lola?Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.72,0:18:37.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Ran away?Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.69,0:18:42.20,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,One of my own beloved older sisters...Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.20,0:18:46.63,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,...ran off to sea to find love.Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.63,0:18:48.38,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,To seek a match of her own.Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.28,0:18:52.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Lola... ran away from home?Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.65,0:18:59.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Cracker-kun, let go of me! I just want to see Lola and Chiffon...Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.33,0:19:03.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I just want to see my daughters!Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.26,0:19:07.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Lola... That Lola... Could it be?Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.54,0:19:11.87,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Lola, you guys went to the New World?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.87,0:19:15.46,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We didn't go there! We were born in the New World!Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.46,0:19:18.00,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,My mama is a pirate, too.Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.00,0:19:19.50,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's right...Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.76,0:19:23.84,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,This is my mama's Vivre Card. I'll let you have it.Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.72,0:19:25.79,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Paper?Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.79,0:19:31.31,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Wow! How lucky! Captain Lola's mama is a great pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.31,0:19:35.48,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Take good care of it! It'll definitely be useful one day!Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.69,0:19:41.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Everything's starting to make sense...Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.19,0:19:46.70,Main,,0,0,0,,In that case, could Lola's mama be...Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.92,0:19:50.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.56,0:19:57.05,Main,,0,0,0,,And this man is...Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.05,0:19:59.72,Main,,0,0,0,,--...Lola's father?! --What?Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.23,0:20:14.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Crane!Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.72,0:20:22.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Crane!Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.45,0:20:25.29,Main,,0,0,0,,They're back! It's the rabbit and the crane!Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.29,0:20:26.41,Main,,0,0,0,,It's... flying!Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.82,0:20:35.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop! Randolph!Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.13,0:21:02.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Was that Haki?! No, not quite...Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.55,0:21:04.03,Main,,0,0,0,,What was it then?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.82,0:21:11.12,Main,,0,0,0,,They screamed...Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.87,0:21:14.96,Main,,0,0,0,,...and withered up out of fear?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.40,0:21:39.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Crane...Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.20,0:21:52.74,Main,,0,0,0,,You must think you're a big shot... if you think you're able to get in my way...Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.00,0:21:55.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Randolph!Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.96,0:21:59.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. That was his idea.Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.96,0:22:02.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Liar! It was yours!Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.06,0:22:04.80,Main,,0,0,0,,They can talk!Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.80,0:22:07.80,Main,,0,0,0,,We are very sorry.Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.00,0:22:12.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Is he someone special?Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.31,0:22:15.81,Main,,0,0,0,,He looks strong, that's for sure.Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.79,0:22:21.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama always has her next move set in motion.Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.21,0:22:25.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Since Straw Hat Luffy defeated Doflamingo...Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.24,0:22:29.90,Main,,0,0,0,,she knew Brûlée would have trouble, so she sent me.Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.90,0:22:33.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't let you just say that, Big Brother!Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.80,0:22:49.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! A tree monster!Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.14,0:22:53.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that woman!Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.97,0:22:57.34,Main,,0,0,600,,If she ordered me to do it,  I would have killed them at once!Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.31,0:22:59.06,Captions,,0,0,0,,Master of the Seducing Woods King BaumDialogue: 0,0:22:57.34,0:22:59.14,Main,,0,0,650,,That's right-ju!Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.14,0:23:01.23,Main,,0,0,0,,We members of the Seducing Woods Team...Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.56,0:23:06.44,Main,,0,0,0,,...have never allowed a single target of ours to leave alive-ju!Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.44,0:23:11.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! It's not just Cracker-sama and Brûlée-sama... King Baum-sama is here, too!Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.03,0:23:14.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe all three of them are here at the same time!Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.21,0:23:18.71,Main,,0,0,0,,That's nice and all, but we can't waste any time.Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.28,0:23:22.87,Main,,0,0,0,,By the middle of the day tomorrow...Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.87,0:23:29.25,Main,,0,0,0,,...the Vinsmoke siblings will arrive at Whole Cake Chateau.Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.25,0:23:35.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Forming a family connection with the Vinsmokes is something that Mama has wanted for a long time.Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.19,0:23:47.95,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll have Germa 66's formidable military and advanced technology.Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.95,0:23:50.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I know that!Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.68,0:24:04.46,Main,,0,0,0,,They've turned into animals!Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.39,0:24:10.69,Main,,0,0,0,,And why is that branch talking?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.69,0:24:12.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not a branch!Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.34,0:24:14.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at this, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.80,0:24:17.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.23,0:24:20.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, Nami! Help!Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.02,0:24:20.93,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.43,0:24:22.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper got caught, too?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.26,0:24:26.40,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened to you guys?! What are you doing in there?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.40,0:24:32.03,Main,,0,0,0,,She trapped us in the mirror! She has a mirror ability! Be careful!Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.14,0:24:38.12,Main,,0,0,0,,How's this, Brother Cracker?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.12,0:24:41.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I've already got these fools...Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.91,0:24:44.71,Main,,0,0,0,,...by the scruff of their necks!Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.34,0:25:01.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper! Carrot! Are you okay?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.57,0:25:03.92,Main,,0,0,0,,We're fine!Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.07,0:25:07.33,Main,,0,0,0,,We're not hurt at all!Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.33,0:25:13.32,Main,,0,0,0,,It's just the mirror that broke. We're safe in this dimension!Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.32,0:25:17.42,Main,,0,0,0,,--So you're okay! --I don't know what you're talking about, but that's good.Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.42,0:25:19.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Listen...Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.14,0:25:25.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Whatever. Let's start with this blabbermouth.Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.49,0:25:30.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you gonna do to me?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.01,0:25:31.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama said I can kill you.Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.38,0:25:34.51,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.53,0:25:40.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-Think about it!Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.50,0:25:45.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm your stepfather, Cracker-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.88,0:25:49.24,Main,,0,0,0,,You used to be! Not anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.24,0:25:58.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama considers her 43 ex-husbands as strangers, unrelated to us by blood.Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.02,0:26:03.50,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare you! But I'm definitely related to my daughters by blood!Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.50,0:26:04.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Enough!Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.08,0:26:09.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I just want to congratulate my daughter!Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.25,0:26:45.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this sympathy?Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.70,0:26:50.75,Main,,0,0,0,,When you see someone dozens of times... you can't help but get a little attached!Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.15,0:26:58.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.84,0:27:00.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you!!Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.51,0:27:19.82,Main,,0,0,0,,This isn't good!Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.82,0:27:24.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Cracker-sama is gonna start a fight here!Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.26,0:27:29.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Homies! Catch those two so we can finish this!Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.39,0:27:31.50,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not safe here! Let's run!Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.76,0:27:34.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.95,0:27:39.11,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll take care of them!Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.11,0:27:41.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get away!Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.75,0:27:47.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's your name?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.52,0:27:49.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Pound.Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.77,0:27:56.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you mention Lola before?Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.07,0:27:58.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Hang on a second...Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.90,0:28:01.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Um...Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.08,0:28:07.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I found it!Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.95,0:28:17.45,Main,,0,0,0,,What's that?Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.45,0:28:21.63,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the Vivre Card of my friend Lola's mom.Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.05,0:28:24.80,Main,,0,0,0,,But I don't know if it's Big Mom's or not...Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.10,0:28:31.87,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?! What's wrong, guys?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.45,0:28:36.98,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, King Baum?! Even you're stopping?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.98,0:28:40.11,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't do it-ju, Brûlée!Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.11,0:28:43.95,Main,,0,0,0,,We Homies cannot fight against her-ju!Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.54,0:28:45.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Why not?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.62,0:28:49.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I can sense Mama's powerful soul-ju!Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.08,0:28:50.91,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.20,0:29:06.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this really Big Mom's Vivre Card?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.86,0:29:19.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! No way.Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.40,0:29:20.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.54,0:29:31.74,Main,,0,0,0,,C-Cracker-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.58,0:29:36.42,Main,,0,0,0,,He has more than two arms!Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.42,0:29:37.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn!Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.87,0:29:40.42,Main,,0,0,0,,That bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.42,0:29:47.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm the Biscuit Knight - Cracker, one of the Three Sweet Commanders.Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.38,0:29:50.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Also known as...Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.24,0:29:54.02,Main,,0,0,0,,...Thousand Arms Cracker.Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.02,0:29:58.64,Main,,0,0,0,,If I tap my arm once, it turns into two.Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.64,0:30:01.02,Main,,0,0,0,,If I do it again...Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.86,0:30:04.69,Main,,0,0,0,,it turns into three.Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.69,0:30:05.65,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.65,0:30:07.41,Main,,0,0,0,,They'll keep multiplying.Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.29,0:30:16.79,Main,,0,0,0,,His legs have multiplied, too.Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.55,0:30:21.50,Main,,0,0,1,,Don't even dream that you can defeat me.Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.25,0:30:24.76,Captions,,0,0,0,,Thousand Arms Cracker One of the Three Sweet Commanders A Member of the Emperor Big Mom Pirates Bounty: 860 Million BellyDialogue: 0,0:30:21.50,0:30:24.76,Main,,0,0,1,,I won't let you interfere with Mama's tea party!Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.76,0:30:26.71,Main,,0,0,0,,You've got extra limbs. So what?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.68,0:30:27.01,Luffy Gear Second,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.68,0:30:27.17,Luffy Gear Second,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:30:26.71,0:30:26.84,Luffy Gear Second,,0,0,0,fx,GDialogue: 2,0:30:26.71,0:30:26.84,Luffy Gear Second,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 2,0:30:26.71,0:30:26.84,Luffy Gear Second,,0,0,0,fx,aD